---
system: sys-01-identity-household-access
flow_id: coppa-consent-record
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/01-identity-household-access#post-v1identitycoppa-consent
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, IdentityService, PostgreSQL]
apis:
  - POST /v1/identity/coppa-consent
  - POST /v1/identity/coppa-consent/{id}/revoke
externals: []
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - invalid_payload
  - consent_already_revoked
  - parent_not_authenticated
idempotency: 24h on X-Request-Id for grant; revoke is idempotent on consent_id
retry: caller-side exponential backoff with jitter on 5xx — never retry on 4xx
timeout: 3s p99
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant IdentityService
    participant PostgreSQL

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: Entry point: onb_coppa screen (ADR-0005 P3.A) — parent submits consent form

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/identity/coppa-consent {child_name, birth_date, consent_version, parent_user_id, X-Request-Id}
    Gateway->>Gateway: auth — require valid parent JWT (Bearer)
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward request
    alt parent_not_authenticated
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 401 parent_not_authenticated
    else invalid_payload
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 422 invalid_payload {field_errors}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 422
    else idempotent_replay (X-Request-Id seen within 24h)
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {consent_id, status: existing}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 existing consent returned
    else success
        IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT coppa_consents {id, parent_user_id, child_name, birth_date, consent_version, granted_at, status: active}
        PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: consent_id
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 201 {consent_id, status: active, granted_at}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 201
        Note over ParentApp,PostgreSQL: consent_id FK gates child profile creation — IdentityService enforces on child-profile-create path
    end

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: --- Revocation alt branch ---

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/identity/coppa-consent/{consent_id}/revoke {reason, X-Request-Id}
    Gateway->>Gateway: auth — require valid parent JWT, verify consent owned by caller
    Gateway->>IdentityService: forward revoke request
    alt consent_already_revoked
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {consent_id, status: revoked} (idempotent)
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
    else parent_not_authenticated
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 401 parent_not_authenticated
    else revoke_success
        IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE coppa_consents SET status='revoked', revoked_at=now(), revoke_reason WHERE id={consent_id}
        PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: updated
        IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {consent_id, status: revoked, revoked_at}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
        Note over IdentityService,PostgreSQL: child profile access gated — dependent child profiles enter suspended state pending re-consent
    end

    Note over ParentApp,IdentityService: timeout 3s p99 — X-Request-Id idempotency 24h — revoke idempotent on consent_id
